{
  "slug": "simple-workflow",
  "name": "Simple Workflow",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Complete development lifecycle plugin with built-in ticket management, Generator-Evaluator quality pipeline, and context conservation for long-running sessions.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills**, **13 agents** and **6 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `audit` (Comprehensive multi-agent code audit that delegates to the code-reviewer and security-scanner sub-agents), `autopilot` (Consume a pre-built ticket list (split-plan.md under .simple-workflow/backlog/product_backlog/{parent-slug}/) and drive the per-ticket /scout -> /impl -> /ship pipeline…), `brief` (Conducts a structured Socratic interview that gathers requirements, then writes a brief and an autopilot policy file for…), `catchup` (Recovers branch state and recommends the next development action after a context reset), `create-ticket` (Do not auto-invoke), `impl` (Do not auto-invoke), `investigate` (Investigates codebase topics by spawning the researcher subagent and writing structured findings to disk), `plan2doc` (Creates an implementation plan by spawning the planner subagent with a size-routed model (sonnet for Size S, opus…), and 5 more\n- **Agents** (13): `ac-evaluator-hi` (AC compliance evaluator), `ac-evaluator` (AC compliance evaluator), `code-reviewer` (Code quality, security, performance, and convention compliance review), `decomposer` (Decompose investigation findings into an ordered list of independently-deployable ticket skeletons with a dependency graph), `doc-verifier` (EC-SELFDOC / doc-truthfulness verifier), `implementer` (Implement code changes following a plan), `planner` (Create detailed implementation plans for features and refactoring), `researcher` (Codebase exploration, dependency tracking, and architecture investigation), and 5 more\n- **Hooks** (6): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`, `PreCompact`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`, `SubagentStop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install simple-workflow@claude-community` from `aimsise/simple-workflow`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 13,
    "agent": 13,
    "hook": 6
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
